---
layout: base.njk
servicesPage: true
permalink: "/services/"
title: "Services | Synergy Solutions"
description: "Executive coaching, keynotes, retreats, team building, leadership and sales training, and more—tailored programs for leaders and organizations."
---

<div class="services-page">
    <div class="services-page__inner">
        <header class="services-page__header">
            <h1 id="services-page-heading" class="services-page__title">Services</h1>
            <p class="services-page__lede">
                Programs tailored to leaders, teams, and organizations—delivered with energy, structure, and tools your people can apply immediately.
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="services-page__grid">
            {% for service in services %}
            <article class="services-page__card">
                <h2 class="services-page__card-title">{{ service.title }}</h2>
                <p class="services-page__card-text">{{ service.description }}</p>
            </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>

        <section class="services-page__cta" aria-labelledby="services-book-heading">
            <h2 id="services-book-heading" class="services-page__cta-title">Bring a program to your team</h2>
            <p class="services-page__cta-copy">
                Share your goals, audience, and timing—Jonathan will follow up with options and next steps.
            </p>
            <a href="/contact" class="services-page__cta-button">Book Jonathan</a>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
